# A System.gc() loop must not grow the commix heap to the maximum.
# Heap_shouldGrow read every explicit collection as a slow mark.
# https://github.com/scala-native/scala-native/issues/5052
# Many small live objects must not grow it for mark time either (#2436).

> set nativeConfig ~= { _.withGC(scala.scalanative.build.GC.commix) }
> runWithMaxHeap 64M
> runWithMaxHeap 512M mark-time

# Marking must not hang when the grey set outgrows the grey packet pool (1% of
# the maximum heap): markers waited for an empty packet while holding them all.
> runWithMaxHeap 128M grey-packet-overflow
